@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5137

### Create a v0.3 question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/
Content-Type: application/json
X-Question-Inbox: 1

{"prompt":"Wie soll es weitergehen?","choices":[{"label":"Einzeltest","impact":"Wenig Aufwand"}],"project":"AgentDesk","requestKey":"manual-v3-question-1"}

### Inbox and live snapshots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/

### Single question
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/replace-with-question-id

### Answer (replace id/version)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/replace-with-question-id/answer
Content-Type: application/json
X-Question-Inbox: 1

{"expectedVersion":1,"decision":{"kind":"answer","text":"Einzeltest"}}

### Streaming snapshots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

### Existing native threads
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/codex/threads

### Native detail (replace UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/codex/threads/replace-with-thread-uuid

### Explicit operator message (sends real work after replacing UUID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/codex/dispatch
Content-Type: application/json
X-Question-Inbox: 1

{"requestKey":"manual-v3-dispatch-1","threadIds":["replace-with-thread-uuid"],"content":{"kind":"message","text":"Fasse deinen Stand kurz zusammen."}}

### Delivery receipts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/codex/dispatch

### Operator task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/work-items/
Content-Type: application/json
X-Question-Inbox: 1

{"title":"Antwort prüfen","workspacePath":"/Users/alexandernachtmann/RiderProjects/AgentDesk","owner":{"kind":"operator"}}

### Work list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/work-items/

### Single task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/work-items/replace-with-task-id

### Complete a task with evidence
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/work-items/replace-with-task-id
Content-Type: application/json
X-Question-Inbox: 1

{"expectedVersion":1,"state":{"kind":"done","evidence":"Antwort im richtigen Thread geprüft."}}
### Current Codex account usage
GET http://localhost:5137/api/codex/usage
